Em-DOSBox
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The tree this project is based on is Em-DOSBox, the Emscripten/web build of
DOSBox by Boris Gjenero.

    Em-DOSBox
    Copyright (C) Boris Gjenero and contributors
    https://github.com/dreamlayers/em-dosbox

The import is the `em-dosbox-svn-sdl2` branch at tip e1f72dd1 ("Update to
DOSBox r4305"), with its `ChangeLog`, `NEWS`, `THANKS` and `README` kept as
they were imported.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
whereq changes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Everything outside the emulator core is the whereq porting work:

    android/      native Android application (NDK + CMake + Java)
    native/       desktop Linux baseline build harness
    bench/        CPU-core throughput probe
    toolchain/    rootless dev toolchain
    third_party/  fetch scripts for the SDL2 sources
    porting/      the porting log, benchmark notes and screenshots
    bin/          release.sh

These are distributed under the same GNU General Public License, version 2,
because they are combined with the DOSBox core into a single work. GPLv2
requires that derivative works be distributed under the same license, so
this project as a whole is GPLv2 - it cannot be relicensed under MIT or any
other more permissive license.

